{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/724","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/724/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/724/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/724/events","html_url":"https://github.com/derio-net/super-fr/issues/724","id":5601043327,"node_id":"I_kwDOR-_5V88AAAABTdkjfw","number":724,"title":"triage: theme comparisons are case/whitespace-sensitive (mixed_themes, suggest)","user":{"login":"YiannisDermitzakis","id":10046982,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDQ2OTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10046982?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis","html_url":"https://github.com/YiannisDermitzakis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10805070195,"node_id":"LA_kwDOR-_5V88AAAAChAhJcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/labels/fr:in-progress","name":"fr:in-progress","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"An agent is actively working on this","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-27T08:13:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T18:22:35Z","closed_at":"2026-09-27T18:22:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Filed from #723's review (finding `r2-2`, out of scope there).\n\n`Judgement.theme` is free text, and nothing normalises it before comparing. `\"Docs\"`, `\"docs\"` and `\"docs \"` count as three different themes.\n\nTwo places compare themes this way:\n\n- `fr.triage.batch.mixed_themes` (new in #723). This is the debug-batch one-root-cause warning. A single theme spelled two ways trips it spuriously.\n- `fr.triage.batch.suggest` (pre-existing). Its theme signal groups by the raw string, so the same theme spelled two ways splits into separate suggestions.\n\nSuggested fix: normalise at one point that both use, for example `casefold().strip()` when comparing. Keep the judgement's own spelling for display. A validator on `Judgement.theme` is another option, but it would rewrite agent-owned text, so comparison-time normalisation is probably the better choice.\n\nLow severity: it's a warning and a suggestion, never a refusal.\n","closed_by":{"login":"YiannisDermitzakis","id":10046982,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDQ2OTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10046982?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis","html_url":"https://github.com/YiannisDermitzakis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/724/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/724/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}